Bundle-Description: Creates a Liferay MVCBean CDI portlet as a WAR project with JSP views.
Bundle-Name: Liferay Project Templates MVCBean CDI JSP Portlet
Bundle-SymbolicName: com.liferay.project.templates.mvcbean.cdi.jsp.portlet
Bundle-Version: 1.0.0
Liferay-Versions: [7.2,8)
-removeheaders:\
	Import-Package,\
	Private-Package,\
	Require-Capability